   "fieldname": "filter_help",
   "fieldtype": "HTML",
   "options": "<div class=\"alert alert-warning\">These filters are not only a quality setting. Upwork's API &amp; MCP Terms prohibit <b>Bulk Access</b> - retrieving all or substantially all of a category of job postings. Keeping the search narrow is what keeps this integration on the permitted side of that line. Do not widen these to match everything.</div>"
