   "fieldname": "compliance_help",
   "fieldtype": "HTML",
   "options": "<div class=\"alert alert-info\">Upwork API Terms &sect;7 and API &amp; MCP Terms &sect;8.3 cap caching of Upwork Content at <b>24 hours</b>, after which it must be permanently deleted, and forbid restarting the timer by re-fetching. The hourly purge enforces this: postings still marked New, Reviewed or Skipped are deleted outright; those you acted on (Proposal Drafted, Applied) keep only your own notes, status and the job link, with all Upwork-authored text stripped.</div>"
  },
